# Witness and Verification Summary: WDC Alternate Status / Drive Address Register (`wdcaltdigin`) Read Decode Defect

The complete witness probe and kill table report has been written and preserved at [`agy_witness_20260911.md`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/wdcaltdigin/agy_witness_20260911.md).

---

### 1. Defect Confirmation & Root Cause

In [`src/devices/dev_wdc.c`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c#L609-L625), [`DEVICE_ACCESS(wdc_altstatus)`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c#L609) registers a 2-byte region (`wdc_altstatus` at `0x3f6` and Drive Address register at `0x3f7`).
- `relative_addr` was decoded in exactly one place: inside the `else` of `writeflag == MEM_READ` ([`#494`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c#L622-L672)).
- The `MEM_READ` path unconditionally calculated `odata = status_byte(d, cpu)` without inspecting `relative_addr`.
- A guest read of offset 1 (`0x3f7`) unconditionally returned the status byte $S$ instead of declining the unmapped read.

Four-cell closure table:
| Access Cell | Offset 0 (`0x3f6`) | Offset 1 (`0x3f7`) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **WRITE** | Alt Ctrl ([`#481`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c#L673-L745)): `WDCTL_RST` triggers soft reset | Drive Address reg ([`#494`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c#L622-L672)): declined store (no reset) |
| **READ**  | Alt Status: returns status byte $S$ ($S \neq 0$) | Drive Address reg (`wdcaltdigin`): declined read (`0x00`) |

---

### 2. Pre-Fix Baseline Measurement (Committed HEAD `8d372aa`)

Measured on committed HEAD `8d372aa` in scratch clone `/tmp/gxaltdigin_clone` on unmodified in-tree machine `evbmips -e malta` (Little-endian MIPS 5Kc, PIIX4 IDE with scratch disk image attached as `iR:`).

- **Raw Log**: [`witness_committed.out`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/wdcaltdigin/witness_committed.out)
- **Score**: **14 / 16**
- **Non-Zero Status Guarantee ($S \neq 0$)**:
  - Power-on / idle Alt Status (offset 0): $S = \mathbf{0x51}$ (`WDCS_DRDY | WDCS_DSC | WDCS_ERR`, set by `dev_wdc_init()`)
  - Armed Alt Status (offset 0): $S_{\text{armed}} = \mathbf{0x58}$ (`WDCS_DRDY | WDCS_DSC | WDCS_DRQ`, set by `arm_a_write()`)
  - Offset 1 power-on read (`s1`): got $\mathbf{0x51}$ (defect leaks $S$, want `0x00`) $\rightarrow$ **FAIL**
  - Offset 1 armed read (`s4`): got $\mathbf{0x58}$ (defect leaks $S_{\text{armed}}$, want `0x00`) $\rightarrow$ **FAIL**
  - All 14 control, accept, and write guard rows passed.

