### 3. Ruled Repair & Post-Fix Measurement (`BASE`)

Applied the ruled repair to [`src/devices/dev_wdc.c`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c#L619-L623):
```c
if (writeflag == MEM_READ) {
    if (relative_addr != 0) {
        /*  Declined read convention: emulator policy pre-zeroes
            registered-device read buffers (#95); return 0 here
            for unmapped offset 1 (Drive Address register / digin).  */
        odata = 0;
    } else {
        debug("[ wdc: read from ALTSTATUS: 0x%02x ]\n",
            (int)odata);
    }
} else if (relative_addr != 0) {
```
- **Raw Log**: [`witness_fix.out`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/wdcaltdigin/witness_fix.out)
- **Score**: **16 / 16** (Clean pass across all 16 rows; offset-1 reads return `0x00`).

