### 5. Two-Part Restoration & Scratch Clone Verification

1. **Source Restoration**: Pristine [`src/devices/dev_wdc.c`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c) restored from frozen HEAD file. `cmp -s` against `GXEMUL-SEC` evaluated **CLEAN**.
2. **Binary Freshness**: Recompiled with `rm -f src/devices/*.o && make -C /tmp/gxaltdigin_clone -j8`. `[ /tmp/gxaltdigin_clone/gxemul -nt dev_wdc.c ]` evaluated **TRUE**.
3. **Sentinel Removal**: `/tmp/gxaltdigin_clone/.MUTANT` dropped before Leg 1 and unlinked **only after** both Part 1 and Part 2 verified.
4. **Git Tree Cleanliness**: No files in `GXEMUL-SEC` source were edited; all outputs reside exclusively under [`regress/artifacts/wdcaltdigin/`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/wdcaltdigin/).

